<title>HONG KONG: ACME Landis posts lower interim profit.</title>
<headline>ACME Landis posts lower interim profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.31	vs 5.68</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.3	 vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.15 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    5.30	vs 9.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		     108.38    vs 170.12</p>
<p>    Company name		 ACME Landis Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 24-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 12</p>
<p>NOTE - ACME Landis Holdings distributes bathroom fittings and tyres.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of an investment property.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
